## Changes needed

### 1. ArmOperation.cs (IL2087, IL2090)
File: `/tmp/sv-da84990db6c1493e8fb44162e3e0e04a/before/ArmOperation.cs`

The `IsResource<T>()` method at line 96 uses reflection on `typeof(T)`:
```csharp
private static bool IsResource<T>() where T : notnull
{
    var isResource = typeof(T).GetConstructor(
                    BindingFlags.NonPublic | BindingFlags.Instance,
                    null,
                    CallingConventions.Any,
                    new Type[] { typeof(ArmClient), typeof(ResourceIdentifier) },
                    null) is not null;
    var obj = Activator.CreateInstance(typeof(T), BindingFlags.NonPublic | BindingFlags.Instance, null, null, null);
```

Add `[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)]` to the generic parameter `T`:
```csharp
private static bool IsResource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T>() where T : notnull
```

Add `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` if not already present.

### 2. GenericOperationSource.cs (IL2087)
File: `/tmp/sv-da84990db6c1493e8fb44162e3e0e04a/before/GenericOperationSource.cs`

The class `GenericOperationSource<T>` uses `typeof(T)` in reflection calls:
- Line 37: `ModelReaderWriter.Read(response.Content, typeof(T))` — requires `PublicConstructors | NonPublicConstructors`
- Line 40: `Activator.CreateInstance(typeof(T), ...)` — requires `NonPublicConstructors`

Add `[DynamicallyAccessedMembers]` to the class-level generic parameter `T`:
```csharp
internal class GenericOperationSource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.PublicConstructors | DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T> : IOperationSource<T>
```

Add `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` — check if it's already imported (it is, at line 8).

### 3. ArmClientBuilderExtensions.cs (IL2026)
File: `/tmp/sv-da84990db6c1493e8fb44162e3e0e04a/before/Extensions/ArmClientBuilderExtensions.cs`

The `AddArmClient<TBuilder, TConfiguration>` method calls `builder.RegisterClientFactory<ArmClient, ArmClientOptions>(configuration)` which has `[RequiresUnreferencedCode]`. Mark the method accordingly:

```csharp
[RequiresUnreferencedCode("Binding strongly typed objects to configuration values is not supported with trimming. Use the Configuration Binder Source Generator.")]
[RequiresDynamicCode("Binding strongly typed objects to configuration values requires generating dynamic code at runtime, for example instantiating generic types.")]
public static IAzureClientBuilder<ArmClient, ArmClientOptions> AddArmClient<TBuilder, TConfiguration>(this TBuilder builder, TConfiguration configuration)
